# Frozen semantic-relevance verdict cache. Keyed by sha256(model|requirement|
# evidence); the requirement/evidence snippets are drawn from local-only test
# inputs (the prod batch CSV + acceptance PII fixtures), so the cache is
# LOCAL-ONLY too. The deterministic test suites read it on the dev machine; it
# is never committed. A fresh checkout fails open (keeps credit) — consistent
# with the batch CSV / acceptance fixtures already being local-only.
*.local.json
